        "timestamp": "11:23 AM · Jul 15, 2026",
        "target (社媒 or Addr)": "@dripsnetwork",
        "description": "Integer type conversion flaw in `DaiDripsHub`'s `give(address,uint128)` function. The function converts `uint128 amt` to `int128` without validating `amt <= type(int128).max`. Attackers pass `2^128 - reserveBalance` (exceeding int128 max), causing `int128(amt)` to become a negative value. `-int128(amt)` then becomes positive, flipping the transfer direction from \"user pays\" to \"reserve withdraws to user,\" draining DAI.",
